"%(a)s has %(questions_a)s questions and %(b)s has %(questions_b)s; at most "
"%(gap)s apart."
msgstr ""
"Fragen – %(a)s: %(questions_a)s, %(b)s: %(questions_b)s; der Unterschied "
"darf höchstens %(gap)s betragen."

